const HOW=['Press 3 for the sickle on grass (fodder), 4 for the axe on stumps, 5 for the hammer on stones. Face the thing and press E.','Hoe (1) tills soil. Plant turnip seeds (Q picks seeds), water (2). Marlowe is the librarian in town.','Turnips take 4 days: water daily. Harvest with the sickle, then use the shipping bin by the house before 5 PM.','Buy potato seeds at Ned\'s. Annika is the rancher in town. Power Berries come from the mountain or the Water Imp.','Be in the town square at 3 PM on Spring 23 (calendar in your house or the church).','Hugh Moo (Barn Dealer) sells cows for 1500g. Save up, then buy one.','Tomato and corn grow in Summer only. Buy seeds at Ned\'s, plant 4 of each.','Buy a second cow. Use the barn menu: feed, brush twice, then milk once.','Go into your house and choose "Watch the evening forecast".','Fall 12 is the Harvest Festival, Fall 20 the Egg Festival. Be in town at 3 PM.','Upgrade your house at Brothers Lumber, then attend Thanksgiving (Winter 10) and Star Night (Winter 24).','On Spring 1 of Year 2, climb the summit stairs from the mountain.','Level 2 house at Brothers Lumber and own 3 cows.','The Sunday peddler sells a Blue Feather (1000g). Give it as a gift to someone with enough hearts.','Fall 20 of Year 2: win the Egg Hunt again.','Level 3 house at Brothers Lumber (needs gold and wood).','Save 10,000g. Ship crops, milk, eggs. The bank earns 2% a week.','Reach Summer 29 of Year 3 and ship everything by 5 PM.','Finish the final goal shown in your objective, then check the journal (J) for loose ends.'];
